<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Australia by six wickets in the first of seven one-day internationals at Buffalo Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 223 for nine (50 overs); South Africa 227-4 (47 overs)</p>
